{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n文献中有时采用引理<REF_0001>第（4）项的方式另作定义，但正如该引理所示，两种定义实际上没有区别。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [], "unknown_terms": [], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008K:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个连续（continuous）映射（map）。\n下列四个集合（sets）之间存在双射（bijections）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 由映射（maps）<MATH_0002>构成的集合（set），\n<STRUCT_0003> 由映射（maps）<MATH_0003>构成的集合（set），\n<STRUCT_0004> 由<MATH_0004>-映射（maps）<MATH_0005>构成的集合（set），以及\n<STRUCT_0005> 所有如下映射（maps）族所成的集合（set）：族中给出<MATH_0006>，遍及所有满足下列条件的开集（open）<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>：<MATH_0009>；该族与所有限制（restriction）映射（maps）相容，\n<STRUCT_0006>\n上述对应以函子方式（functorially）依赖于<MATH_0010>和<MATH_0011>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "bijections", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "以函子方式"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指所讨论的集合。"}, {"source_term": "bijections", "target_term": "双射", "context": "指所列诸集合之间的双射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指以所列映射或映射族为元素的集合。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指以所列映射或映射族为元素的集合。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指以所列映射或映射族为元素的集合。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指以所列映射或映射族为元素的集合。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指拓扑空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "修饰映射，说明映射由限制给出。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "以函子方式", "context": "说明双射对两个给定对象的依赖方式。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008K:proof", "translation": "按定义，层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0001>是一条规则，它给每个开集（open）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>中）指定一个映射（map）<MATH_0004>，且有<MATH_0005>。\n因此，至少就“数据”而言，这恰好是给出<MATH_0006>-映射（map）<MATH_0007>（从<MATH_0008>到<MATH_0009>）所需的。\n为说明集合（sets）（1）与（3）之间有双射（bijection），只需注意，<MATH_0010>是层（sheaves）之间的映射（map），当且仅当相应的映射（maps）族（family）<MATH_0011>满足定义<REF_0001>中的条件。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n回顾一下，<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的层化（sheafification）。\n根据层化（sheafification）的泛性质（universal property），给出层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0014>等同于给出预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0015>，其中<MATH_0016>是在本节前文定义的函子（functor）。\n要给出这样的映射（map）<MATH_0017>，须对每个开集（open）<MATH_0018>（属于<MATH_0019>）指定一个与限制映射（restriction mappings）相容的映射（map）<MATH_0020>。\n我们可以并且确实将<MATH_0021>视为一族映射（maps）<MATH_0022>，对应于所有开集（open）<MATH_0023>，它们在<MATH_0024>中且满足<MATH_0025>。\n这些映射（maps）必须与所有可能的限制映射（restriction mappings）相容。\n换言之，<MATH_0026>对应于（4）所述的一族映射（maps）。\n当然，反过来，这样的族定义一个映射（map）<MATH_0027>，进而定义一个映射（map）<MATH_0028>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n要完成引理的证明，还须说明“遗忘结构（forgetting structure）”所得的对应将（4）所述的族<MATH_0029>配以<MATH_0030>-映射（map）<MATH_0031>，其中<MATH_0032>，且这一对应是双射（bijective）。\n为此，若<MATH_0033>是通常的<MATH_0034>-映射（map），则只需将<MATH_0035>定义为如下复合（composition）：先作<MATH_0036>，再作限制（restruction）映射（map）<MATH_0037>。\n这一定义恰因<MATH_0038>才有意义，即<MATH_0039>。\n证明完毕。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "forgetting structure", "target_term": "遗忘结构"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "restruction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指拓扑空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指所讨论的集合。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "描述两个集合的对应关系。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "指具有指标的一族映射。"}, {"source_term": "sheafif