{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0006", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有时，考虑<MATH_0001>-映射（maps），比考虑同在<MATH_0002>上或同在<MATH_0003>上的层（sheaves）之间的映射（maps）更方便。\n我们如下定义<MATH_0004>-映射（maps）的复合（composition）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "指依次施行给出的两个映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008L:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续（continuous）映射（maps）。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的层（sheaf），<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>上的层（sheaf），<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>上的层（sheaf）。\n设<MATH_0009>是一个<MATH_0010>-映射（map）。\n设<MATH_0011>是一个<MATH_0012>-映射（map）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0013>与<MATH_0014>的复合（composition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是<MATH_0015>-映射（map）<MATH_0016>，由下列图表（diagrams）的交换性（commutativity）定义：\n<MATH_0017>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutativity", "target_term": "交换性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指连续映射的源和目标所在的范畴中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "指依次施行给出的两个映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指由所给映射构成的图表。"}, {"source_term": "commutativity", "target_term": "交换性", "context": "指用于定义复合的图表的交换性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0007", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们把验证这一构造可行的工作留给读者。\n也可以将<MATH_0001>看作复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>\n这样看来，考虑<MATH_0003>-映射（maps）是不是容易一些？\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n最后，给定连续（continuous）映射（map）<MATH_0004>和一个<MATH_0005>-映射（map）<MATH_0006>，便有茎（stalks）上的自然（natural）映射（map）\n<MATH_0007>\n对所有<MATH_0008>均如此。一个元素（element）的代表元（representative）<MATH_0009>（该元素属于<MATH_0010>）的像（image），就是<MATH_0011>中以<MATH_0012>为代表元（representative）的元素（element）。这一构造是良定义（well defined）的，验证留给读者。也可表述为，它是使下列所有图表（diagrams）\n<MATH_0013>\n（其中<MATH_0014>为开集（open））交换（commute）的唯一（unique）映射（map）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "natural", "target_term": "自然"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "unique", "target_term": "唯一"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "指依次施行给出的两个映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指层在相应点处的茎。"}, {"source_term": "natural", "target_term": "自然", "context": "修饰所构造的茎上的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指所讨论的茎中的元素。"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元", "context": "指代表茎中元素的对象。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指代表元在给定映射下的像。"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元", "context": "指代表茎中元素的对象。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指所讨论的茎中的元素。"}, {"source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义", "context": "说明映射的结果不依赖代表元的选取。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指由所给映射构成的图表。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指拓扑空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "指图表中的相应复合相等。"}, {"source_term": "unique", "target_term": "唯一", "context": "说明具有所述性质的映射只有一个。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续（continuous）映射（maps）。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的层（sheaf），<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>上的层（sheaf），<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>上的层（sheaf）。\n设<MATH_0009>是一个<MATH_0010>-映射（map）。\n设<MATH_0011>是一个<MATH_0012>-映射（map）。\n设<MATH_0013>为一点（point）。茎（stalks）上的映射（map）\n<MATH_0014>是复合（composition）\n<MATH_0015>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指连续映射的源和目标所在的范畴中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的层。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指用来取茎的点。"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指层在相应点处的茎。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "指依次施行给出的两个映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008M:proof", "translation": "由定义<REF_0001>和上文茎（stalks）上映射（map）的定义立即得到结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指层在相应点处的茎。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008N:title", "translation": "连续（Continuous）映射（maps）与阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰节标题中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的一组映射。"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "指阿贝尔群的层。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008N:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个连续（continuous）映射（map）。\n我们断言存在函子（functors）\n<MATH_0002>\n其性质与第<REF_0001>节中相应对象的性质类似。\n论证如下。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n每个函子（functors）的构造方式都与相应的函子（functor）相同，后者见第<REF_0002>节。\n这样的构造可行，因为该节中的余极限（colimits）都是有向（directed）余极限（colimits）（不过下文仍会具体说明）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n首先，给定阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0003>（在<MATH_0004>上）和阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0005>（在<MATH_0006>上），我们把\n<MATH_0007>\n定义为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）。限制映射（restriction mappings）与集合预层（presheaves of sets）的限制映射（restriction mappings）相同（而且它们都是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的同态（homomorphisms））。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n对应<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）预层（presheaves）的范畴（categories）上的函子（functors）。\n这一点很清楚，因为例如，阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>\n给出有向系统（directed systems）之间的映射（map）\n<MATH_0011>\n其中的映射（maps）都是同态（homomorphisms），从而给出阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的同态（homomorphism）\n<MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n函子（functors）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>在阿贝尔群（abelian groups）预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）上伴随（adjoint），即有\n<MATH_0015>\n为证明这一点，注意映射（map）<MATH_0016>（来自引理<REF_0003>的证明）是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）。因此，若\n<MATH_0017>\n是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map），则相应的映射（map）<MATH_0018>就是映射（map）\n<MATH_0019>，\n也是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）。反过来，我们指出，映射（map）\n<MATH_0020>\n（见引理<REF_0004>的证明）也是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）（因为它由<MATH_0021>的限制映射（restriction mappings）构成，而它们都是同态（homomorphisms））。因此，给定阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0022>，映射（map）\n<MATH_0023>\n也是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）。由于这两个构造\n<MATH_0024>和<MATH_0025>\n作用于集合预层（presheaves of sets）之间的映射（maps）时互逆（inverse），所以它们作用于阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的映射（maps）时也互逆（inverse）。\n\n<STRUCT_0010><STRUCT_0011>\n若<MATH_0026>是<MATH_0027>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），则<MATH_0028>是<MATH_0029>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。这是由阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的定义以及该结论对集合（sets）层（sheaves）成立得出的，见引理<REF_0005>。这就定义了函子（functor）\n<MATH_0030>，它定义于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的范畴（category）上。\n\n<STRUCT_0012><STRUCT_0013>\n我们仍按先前的方式定义<MATH_0031>。\n<MATH_0032>和<MATH_0033>的伴随性（Adjointness）与集合预层（presheaves of sets）的情形一样，由形式上的论证得出。论证如下：\n<MATH_0034>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "directed systems", "target_term": "有向系统"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_t