{"unit_id": "tag:008O:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个连续（continuous）映射（map）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）。\n设<MATH_0004>。双射（bijection）\n<MATH_0005>（见引理<REF_0001>）是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。\n设<MATH_0008>。双射（bijection）\n<MATH_0009>（见引理<REF_0002>）是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰预层，指阿贝尔群的预层。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指给定空间上的预层。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "描述两个集合的对应关系。"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指所论代数对象的类型。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明给出的双射保持阿贝尔群结构。"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "指阿贝尔群的层。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "描述两个集合的对应关系。"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指所论代数对象的类型。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明给出的双射保持阿贝尔群结构。"}], "notes": []}
