{"unit_id": "tag:008N:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给定连续（continuous）映射（map）<MATH_0001>以及阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的层（sheaves）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>上）和<MATH_0004>（在<MATH_0005>上），就有了<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006>-映射（map）<MATH_0007>（指阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的层（sheaves）之间的映射）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>这一概念。我们可完全仿照定义<REF_0001>来定义它（把集合（sets）之间的映射（maps）换成阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的同态（homomorphisms）），也可直接说它等同于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0008>。下文将直接使用这一概念。考虑<MATH_0009>-映射（maps）在<MATH_0010>与<MATH_0011>之间所成的群（group）。该群与下列两个群（groups）各有典范（canonical）双射（bijection）：\n<MATH_0012>\n和\n<MATH_0013>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n<MATH_0014>-映射（maps）的复合（Composition）的定义方式，与集合（sets）层（sheaves）的<MATH_0015>-映射（maps）的情形完全相同。此外，给定如上的<MATH_0016>-映射（map）<MATH_0017>，其在茎（stalks）上诱导（induced）的映射（maps）\n<MATH_0018>\n都是阿贝尔群（abelian group）的同态（homomorphisms）。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term"