{"unit_id": "tag:008Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续（continuous）映射（map）。\n给定代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>上）和<MATH_0004>（在<MATH_0005>上）。设<MATH_0006>是底层（underlying）集合（sets）层（sheaves）之间的一个<MATH_0007>-映射（map）。若对每个开集（open）<MATH_0008>，集合（sets）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0009>都是<MATH_0010>中的某个态射（morphism）在底层集合（underlying sets）上的作用，则<MATH_0011>来自代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves）之间唯一（unique）的<MATH_0012>-态射（morphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "unique", "target_term": "唯一"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指连续映射的源和目标所在的范畴中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "修饰映射，说明其连续性。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指相应层所取值的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层", "context": "说明由代数结构层忘掉代数结构而得到的集合层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指所讨论的集合。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指拓扑空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指所讨论的集合。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指相应范畴中的态射或所述层之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合", "context": "指忘掉代数结构所得的集合。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指相应层所取值的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构成所讨论映射的层。"}, {"source_term": "unique", "target_term": "唯一", "context": "说明具有所述性质的映射只有一个。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指相应范畴中的态射或所述层之间的态射。"}], "notes": []}
